  <!--
    HSP 2.3d to 2.61 built-ins, from the keyword table each hspcmp.dll, or the HSED2.EXE of
    2.3d and the 2.4 updates, carries ("$104 8 onexit": code, type, name). The token type is the
    table's type times 8: 0x38 system variables, 0x40 program control and memory commands, 0x48
    GUI, file and ll_ commands. The code's high bits are attributes, so the token value is its
    low byte. 2.4 added combox to listbox at 0x48/0x3E-0x4B. Among the 2.4 updates, 2.4c added
    exedir, 2.4d strmid, instr and objsel, and 2.4f continue, with keysend in place of hspmode.
    2.5 added mref and named 0x48/0x42 objmode. 2.55 moved the note commands from 0x48 to 0x40,
    and 2.6 put onerror at 0x40/0x08, where 2.55 had on.

